---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { education } from '@/data/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About — Lorenz Tazan"
  description="About Lorenz Tazan’s hands-on path through technical support, systems, networking, documentation, and automation."
  currentPath="/about"
>
  <div class="page-shell">
    <header class="page-heading">
      <div>
        <h1>Built from support outward</h1>
      </div>
      <p>I approach infrastructure from the point where people, devices, documentation, and reliable operations meet.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="about-grid">
      <article class="prose">
        <h2>How I work</h2>
        <p>My foundation is hands-on technical support: diagnosing what failed, explaining it clearly, documenting the recovery, and leaving the environment easier to maintain. That work expanded into network operations, account-access support, Linux systems, deployment support, and infrastructure automation.</p>
        <p>I am open to IT Support, Service Desk, Desktop Support, Systems, Network, and Cloud or Platform opportunities. The role can change; the operating habits stay consistent: verify the condition, make a recoverable change, document the result, and escalate with useful evidence when the issue crosses a boundary.</p>
        <h2>Current direction</h2>
        <p>I am continuing to deepen Linux, networking, automation, containers, observability, and cloud-platform fundamentals while remaining grounded in end-user support and service reliability.</p>
      </article>

      <aside>
        <section id="education" class="education-plate">
          <h2>Education &amp; Professional Development</h2>
          <strong>{education.degree}</strong>
          <span>{education.institution}</span>
          <span>{education.completion}</span>
          <p>Relevant coursework: {education.coursework.join(', ')}.</p>
          <h3>{education.development}</h3>
          <p>{education.status}</p>
          <p>{education.study}</p>
        </section>
        <section class="evidence-key">
          <h2>Evidence key</h2>
          <dl>
            <dt>Contract engagement</dt><dd>Work performed in a named professional engagement.</dd>
            <dt>Independent business</dt><dd>Hands-on client support delivered through Teknomahika and independent work.</dd>
            <dt>Sanitized architecture</dt><dd>Portfolio-safe documentation derived from real operational experience.</dd>
            <dt>Independent project</dt><dd>Inspectable learning or implementation work; no production outcome is implied.</dd>
          </dl>
        </section>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
